{"availability":"available","full":"DipHldr/AI-Based-Resume-Analyser","name":"AI-Based-Resume-Analyser","description":"The AI Resume Analyzer is a powerful web application that leverages GPT models to instantly evaluate your resume against any job description. Built with a modern tech stack including React, Vite, and Zustand for a blazing-fast user experience, it features robust client-side storage via Puter.js for rapid resume retrieval.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2025-09-15T19:32:50Z","updated":"2025-09-16T06:41:45Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-based-resume-analyser-khaki.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ai-based-resume-analyser-khaki.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.339Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.339Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.339Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.339Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The AI Resume Analyzer is a powerful web application designed to streamline the job application process by intelligently evaluating resumes against specific job descriptions. Leveraging advanced GPT models, it provides comprehensive feedback and analysis, helping job seekers tailor their resumes for better alignment with target roles. This project focuses on delivering a smooth user experience through efficient state management, fast navigation, and robust client-side storage."],"features":["GPT-Powered Analysis: Utilizes cutting-edge GPT models to compare resumes with job descriptions, providing insightful feedback.","Efficient Client-Side Storage: Implements Puter's FileSystem and KV store for rapid and persistent storage of resumes, ensuring quick retrieval without constant server roundtrips.","Global State Management: Manages complex application state seamlessly using Zustand, providing a predictable and performant user interface.","Fast & Dynamic Routing: Leverages React Router in conjunction with Vite for optimized routing, resulting in 25% faster navigation and a snappier user experience.","Modern UI: Built with Tailwind CSS for a clean, responsive, and highly customizable user interface."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DipHldr/AI-Based-Resume-Analyser/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d484cbb0aa05491da8ece19ab779eb6eeabb57cb5e535b94d937250a84be4530","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.488Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.488Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The AI Resume Analyzer is a powerful web application designed to streamline the job application process by intelligently evaluating resumes against specific job descriptions. Leveraging advanced GPT models, it provides comprehensive feedback and analysis, helping job seekers tailor their resumes for better alignment with target roles. This project focuses on delivering a smooth user experience through efficient state management, fast navigation, and robust client-side storage.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DipHldr/AI-Based-Resume-Analyser/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d484cbb0aa05491da8ece19ab779eb6eeabb57cb5e535b94d937250a84be4530","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DipHldr/AI-Based-Resume-Analyser/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.488Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-09-16T06:41:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DipHldr/AI-Based-Resume-Analyser/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:40.488Z","hash":"d484cbb0aa05491da8ece19ab779eb6eeabb57cb5e535b94d937250a84be4530","originalBytes":4892,"storedBytes":4892,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","application","react","gpt","key","project","vite","puter","bash","css","git","job","models","npm","openai","resumes","store","tailwind","user","yarn","zustand","amazingfeature","build","client-side","env","feature","install","puter.js","router","state","analy